### 1. 注册用户
POST http://localhost:8080/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "test",
  "password": "123456"
}


### 2. 登录（获取Token）
POST http://localhost:8080/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "test",
  "password": "123456"
}


